# Calibration experiment output (issue #25): machine-specific numbers, reported
# on the ticket rather than committed
packages/cli/tests/calibration/results.json

# Catalog Root. A learned Flow Skill is shared source and stays tracked, so the
# directory is not ignored wholesale. Everything sensitive or per-machine is:
# Teaching Recordings hold unredacted video, Traces, and events; the Flow Skill
# lock, staging, and backup entries belong to one save; and Agent Flow packages
# are per-machine state until the Agent Flow path is removed (#184).
.contingency/.recordings/
.contingency/.flow-skill.lock
.contingency/.flow-skill-*.tmp
.contingency/.flow-skill-*.backup
.contingency/agent-flows/
.contingency/agent-flow-catalog.json
